OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfternoon
OL,6,Fcloud gradually clearing away to the
OL,7,Fsouth, leaving some evening sunshine
OL,8,Fand plenty of clear spells overnight.
OL,9,FFeeling cooler for many with some very
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA dry and bright morning to
OL,13,Fstart Friday with some patchy cloud in
OL,14,Fthe north. Feeling warm in the sunny
OL,15,Fspells and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
