OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday and Sunday look dry with some
OL,7,Fwarm spells of sunshine, hazy at
OL,8,Ftimes, with gentle winds. A chance of
OL,9,Fsome spells of rain from Sunday
OL,10,Fevening and through Monday.
